Product photographs live here, one per product, named after the product slug:

    assets/img/products/dior-sauvage-edp.jpg

They are generated by  node tools/import-images.mjs  (see README.md →
"Swapping in real product images"). While this folder is empty the storefront
renders its typographic tiles instead, which is the intended default.

Every image is normalised to 1000x1000 on the shared backdrop colour #F6F1E9,
which is also the colour of the product tiles — that is what keeps the grid
looking like one set rather than a patchwork.
